4785			// (c) The create-project route, where every declared style probe exists
4786			// in both lanes: the toolbar, an icon, a raised button and the document.
4787			await page.click(TT_HOME_CREATE_LINK);
4788			await context.expect.page.exists(page, TT_CREATE_FORM);
4789			// The label the seam lives in also carries a `mat-icon`, and with the font
4790			// seam answered in-context that icon renders as its ligature TEXT — so the
4791			// element's exact text content is `open_in_browser` plus the seam, and
4792			// pinning it exactly would be pinning the icon degradation into an
4793			// assertion about a label. The label is asserted to exist, and the seam is
